  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "line_01",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "诺缇雅掀开布帘。村口的石路浸在薄雾里，脚边的草尖还挂着水。三道陌生的影子停在路尽头。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_01.ogg",
      "next": "line_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "绿发战士站在最前面。他身后，一个棕发少年按住胸前的吊坠，红发少女踮脚朝村里张望。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_02.ogg",
      "next": "line_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_03",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "瑞杰路德",
      "portrait_slot": "center",
      "portrait_id": "ruijerd",
      "expression": "watchful",
      "text": "我是瑞杰路德。我们从南边过来。能劳烦你叫一位大人么？",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_03.ogg",
      "next": "line_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_04",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "诺缇雅",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "notia",
      "expression": "hesitant",
      "text": "……请、请在那里等一下。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_04.ogg",
      "next": "the_choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "the_choice",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "face_ruijerd",
          "text": "压住心慌，走上前直视瑞杰路德",
          "check": {
            "stat": "WIL",
            "label": "意志豁免",
            "dc": 12,
            "success_next": "line_08",
            "fail_next": "line_14"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "study_pendant",
          "text": "绕到一旁，看看少年胸前的吊坠",
          "condition": {
            "flag": "noticed_migurd_pendant",
            "equals": false,
            "default": false
          },
          "next": "line_05"
        },
        {
          "id": "retreat",
          "text": "暂时退回木屋，做好准备再来",
          "next": "return_early"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_05",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "她贴着低墙挪了几步。少年衣领里垂着一枚吊坠，磨得发亮的凹纹，是米格路德族的样式。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_05.ogg",
      "next": "line_06"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_06",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "艾莉丝",
      "portrait_slot": "right",
      "portrait_id": "eris",
      "expression": "calm",
      "text": "鲁迪乌斯，你的吊坠又滑出来了。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_06.ogg",
      "next": "line_07"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_07",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "鲁迪乌斯",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "rudeus",
      "expression": "smile",
      "text": "啊，谢谢。老师送的，我可不敢弄丢。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_07.ogg",
      "next": "pendant_seen"
    },
    {
      "id": "pendant_seen",
      "type": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "id": "noticed_migurd_pendant",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "the_choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_08",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "诺缇雅一步步走近。绿发战士察觉她盯着他的长枪，便把枪尖转向地面，退了半步。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_08.ogg",
      "next": "line_09"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_09",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "瑞杰路德",
      "portrait_slot": "center",
      "portrait_id": "ruijerd",
      "expression": "gentle",
      "text": "站在那儿也好。我听得见。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_09.ogg",
      "next": "line_10"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_10",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "诺缇雅",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "notia",
      "expression": "resolved",
      "text": "我叫诺缇雅。你们认识洛琪希吗？那个吊坠……我姐姐也有一个。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_10.ogg",
      "next": "line_11"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_11",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "鲁迪乌斯",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "rudeus",
      "expression": "smile",
      "text": "你是老师的妹妹？我叫鲁迪乌斯。她教我的第一堂课，就是怎么在念咒时把气喘匀。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_11.ogg",
      "next": "line_12"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_12",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "鲁迪乌斯",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "rudeus",
      "expression": "serious",
      "text": "后来我听到了她的新消息。洛琪希老师已经是水王级魔术师了。下次见面，我大概又要被她笑话了。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_12.ogg",
      "next": "line_13"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_13",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "诺缇雅",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "notia",
      "expression": "resolved",
      "text": "水王级……姐姐回家的时候，我要请她亲口说一遍。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_13.ogg",
      "next": "mark_direct"
    },
    {
      "id": "mark_direct",
      "type": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "id": "met_rudeus_directly",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "id": "village_gate_completed",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "return_home"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_14",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "战士转眼的一瞬，诺缇雅只觉得膝盖一软。她退回屋后的阴影，蹲进低墙和木柱之间的空隙。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_14.ogg",
      "next": "line_15"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_15",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "连宽一点的肩膀都挤不进来。诺缇雅把衣摆压在膝下，待父亲的脚步从墙角经过。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_15.ogg",
      "next": "line_16"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_16",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "罗因",
      "portrait_slot": "center",
      "portrait_id": "roin",
      "expression": "low_voice",
      "text": "你那枚吊坠，我认得。洛琪希当年离家时，身边也带着一枚。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_16.ogg",
      "next": "line_17"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_17",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "鲁迪乌斯",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "rudeus",
      "expression": "serious",
      "text": "是她送给我的。我离开前听说，老师已经是水王级魔术师了。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_17.ogg",
      "next": "line_18"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_18",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "罗因",
      "portrait_slot": "center",
      "portrait_id": "roin",
      "expression": "low_voice",
      "text": "在孩子面前我就不提这个了。不过，那吊坠背面刻着旧井的记号。她离家前，有时会把给家里的东西留在那里。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_18.ogg",
      "next": "line_19"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_19",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "鲁迪乌斯",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "rudeus",
      "expression": "serious",
      "text": "旧井，我记住了。等安顿好，我们再来拜访。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_19.ogg",
      "next": "line_20"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_20",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "脚步声散开后，诺缇雅才松开衣摆。她既听到了姐姐的消息，也记住了一个来客不知道她听过的地方。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_20.ogg",
      "next": "line_21"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_21",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "诺缇雅",
      "portrait_slot": "left",
      "portrait_id": "notia",
      "expression": "resolved",
      "text": "水王级。还有……旧井。回去先记在手账上。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_21.ogg",
      "next": "mark_hidden"
    },
    {
      "id": "mark_hidden",
      "type": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "id": "eavesdropped_roxy_clue",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_flag",
          "id": "village_gate_completed",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "return_home"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_22",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "portrait_slot": "",
      "portrait_id": "",
      "expression": "",
      "text": "村口的雾正在散。远道而来的客人已经走开，诺缇雅把姐姐的消息在心里默念一遍，转身回家。",
      "voice": "res://assets/audio/voice/418_village_gate/line_22.ogg",
      "next": "return_home"
    },
    {
      "id": "return_early",
      "type": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "return_home",
      "type": "end"
    }
  ]
}
